  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;meets the line&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;on the&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>-axis, so at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo></math>axis&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;putting in both equation and comparing we get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math>&nbsp;</p><p>And&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;meets the line&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;on the&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math>-axis where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;so putting in both equation and comparing we get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></math></p><p>Therefore,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>24</mn><mn>49</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mn>25</mn><mn>49</mn></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac></math></p></blockquote>",
